```

**Why it qualifies:** When `ListMemos` embeds relations, this path re-applies the same visibility filter so non-viewable related memos are omitted from the response.

---

## 2. Connect/gRPC-Gateway API v1 — ReactionService

**File:** `server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go`

